##Pin Mapping

Component	              | Pin Connection	          | Notes
------------------------|---------------------------|-----------------------------
HX711 DOUT	            | Arduino A0	              | Data from load cell
HX711 CLK	              | Arduino A1	              | Clock for load cell
Potentiometer (Height)	| Arduino A2	              | Analog read for height
Touch Sensor 1 (Head)	  | Arduino Pin 4	            | Capacitive touch, active LOW
Touch Sensor 2 (Thigh)	| Arduino Pin 3	            | Capacitive touch, active HIGH
Touch Sensor 3 (Calf)	  | Arduino Pin 2	            | Capacitive touch, active LOW
Nextion Display RX	    | Arduino Serial2 (TX)	    | Connect to display TX
Nextion Display TX	    | Arduino Serial2 (RX)	    | Connect to display RX
ESP8266 TX              | Serial1 (RX)              | WiFi module communication 
ESP8266 RX              | Serial1 (TX)              | WiFi module communication 
SD Card CS	            | Arduino Pin 53	          | SPI chip select
SD Card SCK	            | Arduino Pin 52	          | SPI clock 
SD Card MOSI	          | Arduino Pin 51	          | SPI data out
SD Card MISO	          | Arduino Pin 50	          | SPI data in
Power                   | 5V / GND                  | External 5V 2A adapter 
